      "writtenOn": "2022-08-24T15:29:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On Apple chips all buffers are made with MTLResourceStorageModeShared. For macs they are made with MTLResourceStorageModeManaged. Only the Managed storage modes need explicit synchronization",
